1
00:01:43,385 --> 00:01:44,265
Sir,

2
00:01:45,065 --> 00:01:46,025
take care.

3
00:01:55,425 --> 00:01:56,425
I'm going.

4
00:02:20,705 --> 00:02:22,305
Why are you in such a hurry?

5
00:02:58,105 --> 00:02:59,225
Wait.

6
00:02:59,945 --> 00:03:02,345
From what I remember, you never left.

7
00:03:04,145 --> 00:03:06,345
Sir, you must be mistaken.

8
00:03:07,225 --> 00:03:08,865
I've been teaching
in Beijing this whole time.

9
00:03:11,705 --> 00:03:12,625
Officer He.

10
00:03:14,665 --> 00:03:15,625
It's really you.

11
00:03:17,505 --> 00:03:18,465
Xiaohe, right?

12
00:03:20,825 --> 00:03:21,785
You don't recognize me?

13
00:03:23,065 --> 00:03:25,065
It's me. Qian Daqun.

14
00:03:25,145 --> 00:03:26,985
I used to be the property manager
at Yuanlongli.

15
00:03:27,065 --> 00:03:28,945
Now I'm just doing alright.

16
00:03:29,025 --> 00:03:32,145
I'm a deputy manager
for the new developer there.

17
00:03:32,865 --> 00:03:35,265
I'm handling Yuanlongli's
relocation project.

18
00:03:35,865 --> 00:03:36,705
What a coincidence.

19
00:03:37,705 --> 00:03:38,745
Ran's back.

20
00:03:38,825 --> 00:03:40,385
He's back too.

21
00:03:40,905 --> 00:03:42,025
Who?

22
00:03:42,105 --> 00:03:43,865
Mr. Qian, you must be busy.

23
00:03:43,945 --> 00:03:45,585
We won't hold you up.

24
00:03:45,665 --> 00:03:46,785
What do you mean by who?

25
00:03:46,865 --> 00:03:48,425
My apprentice, Ran Fangxu.

26
00:03:48,505 --> 00:03:49,585
You don't know him?

27
00:03:50,425 --> 00:03:51,705
Isn't Ran Fangxu already dead?

28
00:03:53,265 --> 00:03:54,505
What are you on about?

29
00:03:54,585 --> 00:03:55,825
Have you lost your mind?

30
00:03:55,905 --> 00:03:57,345
He's standing right here.

31
00:03:57,945 --> 00:03:59,305
What kind of nonsense is that?

32
00:03:59,825 --> 00:04:03,625
I get it. Officer He,
you're messing with me, right?

33
00:04:04,225 --> 00:04:06,145
It's broad daylight.
You're not scaring me.

34
00:04:06,225 --> 00:04:09,385
Still, Officer Ran passed away so young.

35
00:04:09,465 --> 00:04:11,385
It's a real shame.

36
00:04:11,465 --> 00:04:13,905
Are you blind? Ran's right…

37
00:04:13,985 --> 00:04:14,825
WEIYANG STATION

38
00:04:17,705 --> 00:04:18,545
Ran?

39
00:04:20,905 --> 00:04:21,985
Ran Fangxu?

40
00:04:22,064 --> 00:04:23,585
He was here.

41
00:04:25,025 --> 00:04:27,185
What's wrong with him? Has he gone senile?

42
00:04:27,265 --> 00:04:30,105
When Officer Ran died, it was brutal.
Even I know about that.

43
00:04:30,185 --> 00:04:31,225
-Stop talking.
-How could he not know?

44
00:04:31,305 --> 00:04:33,065
What did you say? Shut your trap!

45
00:04:33,145 --> 00:04:34,065
-Dad.
-Officer He.

46
00:04:34,145 --> 00:04:35,625
-What did you just say?
-Stop!

47
00:04:35,705 --> 00:04:37,265
Let's not argue with him. Mr. Qian.

48
00:04:37,345 --> 00:04:38,625
You should go.

49
00:04:39,225 --> 00:04:40,665
-Dad.
-He must be senile.

50
00:04:41,505 --> 00:04:43,265
He Xiaohe, what's wrong with you?

51
00:04:43,345 --> 00:04:45,225
He kept saying Mr. Ran was dead.

52
00:04:45,305 --> 00:04:46,345
Didn't you hear him?

53
00:04:46,425 --> 00:04:47,865
You should've backed me up
and shut him down.

54
00:04:47,945 --> 00:04:48,985
We should beat him up.

55
00:04:49,065 --> 00:04:50,105
Ran Fangxu.

56
00:04:51,105 --> 00:04:53,305
Where are you? Ran Fangxu,

57
00:04:53,905 --> 00:04:55,545
-come out.
-Dad.

58
00:04:55,625 --> 00:04:56,945
I'll say it one more time. Stop hiding.

59
00:04:57,025 --> 00:04:58,145
-Dad, listen to me.
-Let go.

60
00:04:58,825 --> 00:05:01,225
Ran Fangxu! Get out here!

61
00:05:01,305 --> 00:05:02,185
Dad.

62
00:05:02,265 --> 00:05:03,305
Don't stop me.

63
00:05:03,385 --> 00:05:05,745
I'm going to the station right now
to pull the surveillance footage.

64
00:05:05,825 --> 00:05:07,585
I'll find out where he's hiding.

65
00:05:07,665 --> 00:05:09,825
Let go. Ran Fangxu!

66
00:05:09,905 --> 00:05:10,825
Get out here!

67
00:05:10,905 --> 00:05:12,705
-Dad.
-What are you doing?

68
00:05:13,305 --> 00:05:14,465
Let go.

69
00:05:14,545 --> 00:05:15,545
What are you doing?

70
00:05:16,065 --> 00:05:17,345
Ran Fangxu!

71
00:05:17,425 --> 00:05:18,905
Come out, Ran Fangxu!

72
00:05:18,985 --> 00:05:20,465
Where are you hiding, rascal?

73
00:05:20,545 --> 00:05:21,625
Get out here!

74
00:05:22,945 --> 00:05:26,025
-Did you hear me?
-Mr. Ran is already dead.

75
00:05:30,065 --> 00:05:31,425
What… What did you say?

76
00:05:37,625 --> 00:05:38,505
Mr. Ran has been dead.

77
00:05:42,865 --> 00:05:44,465
For twelve years.

78
00:05:54,465 --> 00:05:56,625
Young man, have you seen Ran?

79
00:05:56,705 --> 00:05:58,545
Ran Fangxu's holed up in the archives.

80
00:05:59,345 --> 00:06:01,105
He won't pick up his phone.

81
00:06:01,185 --> 00:06:02,345
Slacker.

82
00:06:02,945 --> 00:06:04,305
This is He.

83
00:06:10,225 --> 00:06:12,145
-Sir.
-What is that?

84
00:06:15,265 --> 00:06:16,625
Don't waste my time.

85
00:06:16,705 --> 00:06:17,825
Get out of the car.

86
00:06:18,945 --> 00:06:20,105
Out now.

87
00:06:20,865 --> 00:06:24,465
Something's wrong with this place.

88
00:06:24,545 --> 00:06:28,985
Let go. I want to know
how I end up on that wall.

89
00:06:33,625 --> 00:06:34,865
Easy, easy.

90
00:06:36,505 --> 00:06:37,665
Ran!

91
00:06:39,265 --> 00:06:40,225
Ran!

92
00:06:42,905 --> 00:06:43,905
Ran!

93
00:06:45,865 --> 00:06:47,625
Hurry up.

94
00:06:49,025 --> 00:06:50,265
You're so clumsy.

95
00:07:00,545 --> 00:07:02,145
Stop playing dumb.

96
00:07:03,465 --> 00:07:04,585
Mr. He,

97
00:07:05,625 --> 00:07:08,305
it's time to let go.

98
00:07:09,105 --> 00:07:10,025
Dad.

99
00:07:10,545 --> 00:07:12,025
Don't dwell on the past.

100
00:07:12,105 --> 00:07:15,985
<i>Once we join hands, we are unstoppable.</i>

101
00:07:16,585 --> 00:07:18,705
Sir, just let it go.

102
00:07:18,785 --> 00:07:21,425
It's not worth spending your whole life
chasing one case.

103
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:24,945
<i>If you hadn't insisted on digging into it,</i>

104
00:07:25,025 --> 00:07:27,545
<i>who knows how many more lives</i>
<i>this cursed building would've taken?</i>

105
00:07:29,625 --> 00:07:30,545
He.

106
00:07:33,505 --> 00:07:35,545
Just let Ran go.

107
00:07:35,625 --> 00:07:39,665
<i>As your mentor, I'm ordering you</i>
<i>to stay in Weiyang.</i>

108
00:08:10,945 --> 00:08:14,465
<i>Sir, did you bring me here</i>
<i>to look for the kid?</i>

109
00:08:14,545 --> 00:08:15,865
<i>Or for something else?</i>

110
00:08:15,945 --> 00:08:17,705
<i>Why do you keep coming back to Yuanlongli?</i>

111
00:08:17,785 --> 00:08:19,785
<i>I can't keep an eye on him,</i>
<i>restrain him, or stop him.</i>

112
00:08:19,865 --> 00:08:22,225
<i>Sir, stop going to Yuanlongli.</i>

113
00:08:22,305 --> 00:08:24,185
<i>You're not to touch</i>
<i>the Yuanlongli case again.</i>

114
00:08:24,265 --> 00:08:25,545
<i>And you're not to go back there either.</i>

115
00:08:25,625 --> 00:08:28,345
<i>You've brought me here again and again.</i>
<i>What exactly are you trying to do?</i>

116
00:08:28,425 --> 00:08:29,265
<i>Not even once more.</i>

117
00:08:29,345 --> 00:08:31,425
<i>You just want to keep me in Weiyang</i>

118
00:08:31,505 --> 00:08:33,065
<i>and pull me back into the case</i>
<i>from 18 years ago, don't you?</i>

119
00:08:33,144 --> 00:08:34,505
-<i>And then what?</i>
-<i>Then,</i>

120
00:08:34,585 --> 00:08:37,425
<i>he stays in Weiyang and returns</i>
<i>to the Criminal Department.</i>

121
00:08:38,225 --> 00:08:39,904
<i>Sir, stop going to Yuanlongli.</i>

122
00:08:39,985 --> 00:08:41,825
-<i>Just let Ran go.</i>
-<i>Stop dwelling on the past.</i>

123
00:08:41,904 --> 00:08:43,465
<i>It's time to let go.</i>

124
00:08:43,545 --> 00:08:45,465
-<i>Stop going back there.</i>
-<i>Stop dwelling on the past.</i>

125
00:08:45,545 --> 00:08:47,265
<i>Sir, just let it go.</i>

126
00:08:47,345 --> 00:08:48,705
<i>I can't.</i>

127
00:08:54,665 --> 00:08:57,025
<i>Sir, I'm going.</i>

128
00:08:57,105 --> 00:08:58,265
<i>Take care.</i>

129
00:08:58,945 --> 00:09:00,145
<i>Dad!</i>

130
00:09:01,745 --> 00:09:06,945
NO. 1 PEOPLE'S HOSPITAL

131
00:09:20,345 --> 00:09:22,505
CARDIOLOGY

132
00:09:26,505 --> 00:09:27,625
Xiaohe.

133
00:09:29,225 --> 00:09:29,945
Xiaohe.

134
00:09:34,625 --> 00:09:37,985
Why is Mr. He's episode
taking so long this time?

135
00:09:38,065 --> 00:09:39,345
He's even been hospitalized.

136
00:09:39,425 --> 00:09:41,865
He ran into a real case
at Yuanlongli this time.

137
00:09:43,105 --> 00:09:43,945
A real case?

138
00:09:47,585 --> 00:09:51,305
These past two years,
every time he thought he saw Mr. Ran,

139
00:09:51,385 --> 00:09:52,865
he'd drag him back
to Yuanlongli to investigate.

140
00:09:53,545 --> 00:09:54,865
I couldn't stop him.

141
00:09:55,385 --> 00:09:57,305
So I worked with everyone.

142
00:09:57,985 --> 00:10:00,105
We staged a fake missing child case
to keep him occupied.

143
00:10:00,825 --> 00:10:03,345
Ms. Feng, Ma Qiang, and Li Tieling.

144
00:10:03,425 --> 00:10:04,745
They all helped me.

145
00:10:04,825 --> 00:10:06,465
Once the child was found,

146
00:10:06,545 --> 00:10:08,585
we'd take Mr. Ran
to the train station and send him off.

147
00:10:08,665 --> 00:10:10,425
And my dad would snap out of it.

148
00:10:13,585 --> 00:10:15,785
We didn't expect
there to actually be a missing child

149
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,785
in Yuanlongli this time.

150
00:10:18,425 --> 00:10:19,745
Things got out of our hands.

151
00:10:20,945 --> 00:10:24,985
At the station just now, Qian Dajun
insisted on saying Mr. Ran had already…

152
00:10:31,225 --> 00:10:32,265
Qian Dajun, seriously?

153
00:10:32,345 --> 00:10:33,985
Does he think before he speaks?

154
00:10:34,825 --> 00:10:36,545
Wasted everyone's time.

155
00:10:38,145 --> 00:10:39,825
The patient's awake. You can go in now.

156
00:10:42,665 --> 00:10:43,705
Dad,

157
00:10:44,385 --> 00:10:45,625
are you feeling any better?

158
00:10:47,185 --> 00:10:49,745
Mr. He, I'm Qiao.

159
00:10:50,385 --> 00:10:51,825
Are you alright?

160
00:10:51,905 --> 00:10:54,425
Mr. He, I'm Zhao Jie.

161
00:10:54,505 --> 00:10:56,225
The team is here to visit you.

162
00:11:07,745 --> 00:11:09,185
He Yuanhang, are you clear-headed or not?

163
00:11:09,265 --> 00:11:10,105
Answer us.

164
00:11:12,225 --> 00:11:13,265
He,

165
00:11:14,025 --> 00:11:16,065
Captain Ran just called.

166
00:11:16,145 --> 00:11:17,625
He's arrived in Beijing.

167
00:11:17,705 --> 00:11:18,945
He told you not to worry.

168
00:11:19,025 --> 00:11:20,265
Yeah.

169
00:11:20,345 --> 00:11:21,945
Captain Ran heard you were hospitalized.

170
00:11:22,025 --> 00:11:23,065
He was worried sick.

171
00:11:23,145 --> 00:11:24,505
-He asked me to--
-Enough.

172
00:11:27,345 --> 00:11:28,545
I remember everything now.

173
00:11:29,825 --> 00:11:30,705
Ran

174
00:11:31,545 --> 00:11:32,825
is gone.

175
00:11:42,425 --> 00:11:45,705
The whole team has been going
along with this for over two years.

176
00:11:45,785 --> 00:11:49,625
If it flares up again, no one can take it.

177
00:11:52,345 --> 00:11:53,385
Xiaohe.

178
00:11:55,745 --> 00:11:58,745
In the first few years
after Captain Ran passed away,

179
00:11:59,545 --> 00:12:00,465
I used to dream about him all the time.

180
00:12:02,185 --> 00:12:06,065
Everyone on the force
who knew him missed him.

181
00:12:07,385 --> 00:12:08,425
Right.

182
00:12:08,505 --> 00:12:11,065
Every time we hit a tough case, we think,

183
00:12:11,585 --> 00:12:12,905
if only Captain Ran were still here.

184
00:12:12,985 --> 00:12:15,585
But he's passed away for many years.

185
00:12:15,665 --> 00:12:19,665
He wouldn't want us
to sigh over him every day.

186
00:12:20,505 --> 00:12:21,545
It's meaningless.

187
00:12:24,745 --> 00:12:26,745
Go back and talk to Mr. He.

188
00:12:27,425 --> 00:12:28,305
He needs to move on.

189
00:12:45,825 --> 00:12:46,945
Xiaohe.

190
00:12:51,105 --> 00:12:53,465
I know a really good therapist.

191
00:12:53,545 --> 00:12:55,905
Take Mr. He to see him when you have time.

192
00:12:55,985 --> 00:12:58,105
TONG YUNKAI, PSYCHOLOGIST

193
00:13:19,825 --> 00:13:21,305
GET RICH

194
00:15:52,225 --> 00:15:54,385
<i>The Japan-Korea FIFA World Cup</i>
<i>is about to begin.</i>

195
00:15:54,465 --> 00:15:56,305
<i>China, making its first-ever</i>
<i>World Cup appearance,</i>

196
00:15:56,385 --> 00:16:00,465
<i>has been drawn into Group C</i>
<i>with Brazil, Turkey, and Costa Rica.</i>

197
00:16:00,545 --> 00:16:04,225
<i>Let us look forward to a strong showing</i>
